  "original_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"primary-heading\" class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col h-full max-w-[1024px]\"><h1 id=\"primary-heading\" class=\"sr-only\">Home</h1><div><div class=\"max-w-[680px] m-auto px-1 flex flex-col gap-y-6\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">SMLC Launch Resources</h1><div class=\"border-b border-slate-200\"></div><div id=\"pm-1\" class=\"border-0 flex flex-col gap-y-4 ProseMirror\" data-context=\"doc\" data-input-id=\"pm-doc-html-3a2be795-6e63-4cd9-860a-8e1a11c66068\" data-editable=\"false\" data-progress=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\" translate=\"yes\"><p><b>Welcome! This page features resources and information for the virtual launch of the 2025-26 SMLC online courses.</b></p><div class=\"grid place-items-center\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-row justify-between group w-full\" id=\"image-view-a47c1cf5-60e6-4c42-8acf-b6313bf5d0fc\"><a data-type=\"image-ref\" class=\"self-center w-full\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/com.appolearning.files/production/uploads/uploaded_file/ebb6dced-4644-4a10-8ec4-ed8e900ca87d/NWP_Pittsburgh_2019_1271.jpg\" class=\"w-full\"/></a></div></div><p><b>For your course syllabus that details the 24-25 year:</b></p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p><a href=\"https://participate.community/pages/24-25-course-syllabus-elementary-smlc-source-based-argument\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Elementary: Source-Based Argument</span></a></p></li><li class=\"\"><p><a href=\"https://participate.community/pages/24-25-course-syllabus-secondary-smlc-source-based-argument\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Secondary: Source-Based Argument</span></a></p></li><li class=\"\"><p><a href=\"https://participate.community/resources/24-25-course-syllabus-smlc-writing-for-change/d1e4d9b2-6f22-4659-9057-5f91e20708f5/editv2\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Writing for Change</span></a></p></li></ul><div data-type=\"event-embed\" data-event-id=\"9b1369eb-c769-4b90-bae8-9472302a9185\" data-event-type=\"event\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"https://participate.community/e/9b1369eb-c769-4b90-bae8-9472302a9185\" class=\"flex flex-col border border-slate-300\"><div class=\"font-bold bg-slate-300 h-6 w-full pl-4\">Event</div><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\"><p class=\"font-bold line-clamp-1\">SMLC Launch</p><p class=\"text-slate-600 line-clamp-2\">This 1 hour real-time Zoom event will bring together new and returning teachers who are participating in the Missouri Show Me Literacies Collaborative (SMLC) program. During our time together, we will connect to continue building our online learning community, explore the overall approach to teaching argument writing for the courses, and further orient ourselves to the courses and the Participate platform.  \n\nThere will also be time in breakout discussions for participants to explore the plan for the course series they are participating in, including the timeline, processes, and learning opportunities for the year.\n\nWe are looking forward to seeing you all for the launch of the 2025-26 SMLC online courses!</p><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">participate.community</p></div><img class=\"h-32 w-32 border-l border-slate-300 object-cover\" src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/27511d3-V2%20space%20banners%20%2834%29.png\"/></div></a></div><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><div class=\"grid place-items-center\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-row justify-between group w-full\" id=\"image-view-d347c416-e136-494a-b379-abe62ac72cd5\"><a data-type=\"image-upload\" data-file-id=\"6908e422-76d9-4bd4-bd10-c67e7e448e23\" class=\"self-center w-full\"><img src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/8961970-Section%20Breaks%20%288%29.png\" class=\"w-full\"/></a></div></div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-launch-resources\">🚀 Launch Resources</h2><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\" id=\"h_-launch-resources__h_-session-recording\">🎥 Session Recording</h3><div contenteditable=\"false\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%;\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"2024 SMLC Event\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aPMiWodkR80?enablejsapi=1&amp;origin=https%3A%2F%2Fparticipate.community&amp;widgetid=1&amp;forigin=https%3A%2F%2Fparticipate.community%2Fdocs%2F3a2be795-6e63-4cd9-860a-8e1a11c66068%3Fexport_id%3D16b710b4-e7c4-4262-ace8-f893a13aece4%26capture_ref%3D%2523Ref%253C0.1408646762.2066481153.255961%253E&amp;aoriginsup=1&amp;aorigins=https%3A%2F%2Fstaff.participate.community&amp;vf=1\" id=\"widget2\"></iframe></div></div><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\" id=\"h_-launch-resources__h_-slideshow\">🖥️ Slideshow</h3><iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQqvasZ8kuoiyauhsW2Zcd2J4MaSys9arGCwSCbLieM_RHYxUpOHb3h6Nyiy7V9hRAX7lwsn_IRsdTj/embed?start=false&amp;loop=false&amp;delayms=3000\" height=\"569\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" title=\"Iframe for url: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQqvasZ8kuoiyauhsW2Zcd2J4MaSys9arGCwSCbLieM_RHYxUpOHb3h6Nyiy7V9hRAX7lwsn_IRsdTj/embed?start=false&amp;loop=false&amp;delayms=3000\" style=\"width: 100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></iframe><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\" id=\"h_-launch-resources__h_-agenda\">🗒️ Agenda</h3><p><b>Welcome and Introductions</b></p><p><b>Writing into the Meeting: Breakthroughs</b></p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p>Write</p></li><li class=\"\"><p>Share out in breakouts</p></li></ul><p><b>Program Overview and Background</b></p><ul 