AOvVaw3-XzBJb9Ph_qdDKhuIMohi\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Syllabus: Secondary Source-Based Argument</span></a></p></li><li class=\"\"><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://app.participate.com/groups/24-25-smlc-writing-for-change/ac473b60-c7bb-4f66-9c52-f8bd7c0c61db/pages/24-25-course-syllabus-smlc-writing-for-change&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1729178074109985&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zpnzsLbNr2u3PKetqJsGC\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Syllabus: Writing for Change</span></a></p></li></ul><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\" id=\"h_-launch-resources__h_-breakout-discussions\">💬 Breakout Discussions</h3><div class=\"grid place-items-center\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-row justify-between group w-full\" id=\"image-view-8c779a9b-e822-4a5e-a73e-3072591ed9b3\"><a data-type=\"image-upload\" data-file-id=\"81d1f762-3f74-4544-be1d-12a650085781\" class=\"self-center w-full\"><img src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/3789158-Blue%20%26%20Purple%20Dotted%20Welcome%20Twitter%20Header%20%284%29.png\" class=\"w-full\"/></a></div></div><p><i>Returning Teachers:</i></p><p>Take a few minutes to share about your experiences in Year One:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p>What do you know now that you wish you had known at this time last year?</p></li><li class=\"\"><p>What worked for you? What was challenging?</p></li><li class=\"\"><p>What tips and tricks do you have (working in Participate or in the program as a whole)?</p></li></ul><p><i>New Teachers:</i></p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p>What questions do you have? What are you wondering about?</p></li><li class=\"\"><p>What are you excited about?</p></li></ul><p><b>Closure</b></p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p>Whole Group</p><p>+Takeaways from breakout discussions</p><p>+Q and A</p></li></ul><p>Bookmark your Group in Participate:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p>Cohort 3 (New Teachers)</p><p>+<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://app.participate.com/groups/24-25-elementary-smlc-source-based-argument/b73ea4d6-7680-407d-9487-897640ee421a&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1729178074111694&amp;usg=AOvVaw1M8HHHzWbVdNDHEy3ivgDw\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Group: Elementary Source-Based Argument</span></a></p><p>+<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://app.participate.com/groups/24-25-secondary-smlc-source-based-argument/f05cccbb-83ae-40f9-bbb6-93a3f51ab73b&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1729178074111969&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Q-4MaQZJXl2NzdB3RJ1Ry\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Group: Secondary Source-Based Argument</span></a></p></li><li class=\"\"><p>Cohort 2 (Year 2 Teachers)</p><p>+<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://app.participate.com/groups/24-25-smlc-writing-for-change/ac473b60-c7bb-4f66-9c52-f8bd7c0c61db&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1729178074112289&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GkpVGVic4L6z9_TZ4ILSy\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Group: Writing for Change</span></a></p></li><li class=\"\"><p>Cohort 1 (Year 3 Teachers)</p><p>+<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://app.participate.com/groups/teacher-research-and-inquiry-24-25-smlc-group/400fe496-7625-475e-991d-5c9c7523bfb7/admin/dashboard&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1729178074112628&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hY-a8X7UNvtSAzOIAuMlC\" class=\"underline\" target=\"\"><span>Group: Teacher Research and Inquiry</span></a></p><p>+Online Course Co-Facilitators</p><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p></li></ul><div class=\"grid place-items-center\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-row justify-between group w-full\" id=\"image-view-9ea78f02-8eec-4afd-88ca-4afd25316c82\"><a data-type=\"image-upload\" data-file-id=\"6908e422-76d9-4bd4-bd10-c67e7e448e23\" class=\"self-center w-full\"><img src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/8961970-Section%20Breaks%20%288%29.png\" class=\"w-full\"/></a></div></div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\" data-version=\"0\" id=\"h_-connect-with-thinking-partner\">🏅 Connect With Thinking Partner</h2><p><b>Now we invite you to connect with your Thinking Partner and take some time to reflect on today’s launch.</b></p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6\"><li class=\"\"><p>What resonated with you from the launch? Share 2-3 takeaways from your experience.</p></li><li class=\"\"><p>Now that you know a little more about this year&#39;s courses and NWP’s approach to teaching argument writing, what are you most excited about? What questions do you have?</p></li></ul><p>Click on the badge below to share your responses.</p><div data-type=\"badge-embed\" data-badge-id=\"169f38eb-f416-4337-8ded-7afd9273bfb9\" data-badge-type=\"micro_credential\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"https://participate.community/badge/169f38eb-f416-4337-8ded-7afd9273bfb9\" class=\"flex flex-col border border-slate-300\"><div class=\"font-bold bg-slate-300 h-6 w-full pl-4\">Micro Credential</div><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\"><p class=\"font-bold line-clamp-1\">2025 SMLC Launch</p><p class=\"text-slate-600 line-clamp-2\">This micro credential recognizes individuals who have engaged in thoughtful reflection on the launch of the 2024 SMLC. Participants will connect with a Thinking Partner, reflect on key takeaways, and articulate insights and questions regarding the courses and teaching approaches introduced by NWP.</p><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">participate.community</p></div><img class=\"h-32 w-32 border-l border-slate-300 object-cover\" src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/127b9d4-Badge%20%2833%29.png\"/></div></a></div><p><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"/></p></div><div id=\"doc-capture-source\" class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><ul class=\"flex flex-col absolute border-2 rounded-md bg-white outline-0 z-20 text-slate-500\" id=\"slash-menu\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"group flex 